data/raw/ai_act.xhtml, data/raw/ai_act_2026-07-27.xhtml
--------------------------------------------------------
The corpus in data/raw/ is Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, reproduced via the EU
Publications Office: the text as published in the Official Journal of the
European Union (CELEX 32024R1689), and the consolidated text as amended by
Regulation (EU) 2026/1744, dated 27 July 2026 (CELEX 02024R1689-20260727). The
consolidated text is a documentation tool with no legal effect; only the
Official Journal texts are authentic. Reuse of Commission documents is governed by Decision
2011/833/EU. This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by the European
Union, and nothing here is legal advice.

data/raw/guidelines/*.pdf
-------------------------
Four Communications from the European Commission, as published by it:
Guidelines on the definition of an artificial intelligence system (C(2025) 5053
final), Guidelines on prohibited artificial intelligence practices (C(2025)
5052 final), Guidelines on the scope of the obligations for providers of
general-purpose AI models (C(2025) 7719 final) and Guidelines on the
implementation of the transparency obligations for certain AI systems under
Article 50 (C(2026) 7702 final). (c) European Union. Reuse of Commission
documents is governed by Decision 2011/833/EU. data/processed/
chunks_guidelines.jsonl is their body text cut into numbered paragraphs, with
footnotes left out; the PDFs are the reference.
